ent","Registration","Hospital Information System","Clinical Department","Diagnostics","Billing","Insurance / TPA","Discharge","Patient Feedback"]}]},{"heading":"Patient Communication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop competence in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Clear explanations"},{"text":"Empathy"},{"text":"Telephone etiquette"},{"text":"Email communication"},{"text":"Multilingual communication where relevant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Difficult situations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to handle:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Long waiting times"},{"text":"Billing disputes"},{"text":"Appointment delays"},{"text":"Doctor availability issues"},{"text":"Insurance delays"},{"text":"Patient complaints"},{"text":"Family concerns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Service recovery"},{"type":"flow","items":["Listen","Understand","Acknowledge","Verify Facts","Provide Appropriate Resolution","Escalate When Necessary","Document","Follow Up"]}]},{"heading":"Insurance & TPA Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop working knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Health insurance"},{"text":"Cashless treatment"},{"text":"Pre-authorization"},{"text":"Claim documentation"},{"text":"TPA coordination"},{"text":"Package limits"},{"text":"Exclusions"},{"text":"Discharge authorization"},{"text":"Claim status"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand that insurance rules vary by insurer and policy, so staff should follow the hospital's current procedures and payer requirements."}]},{"heading":"Hospital Revenue Awareness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basic relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Patient","Service","Billing","Payment","Claim"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OPD billing"},{"text":"IPD billing"},{"text":"Diagnostic charges"}